 "pose": {
  "_about": "How items rest. data/item-models.json gives each item's box on an upright flat stand. Swords, knives and shields already lie on a flat stand (sword top 0.07 m, 1.27 m long). Axes, maces, sledges, pickaxes and farm tools stand on their head or end (axe top 0.89 m, sledge 1.38 m, battleaxe 1.68 m): Tyler, 2026-11-12, 'an axe sticking straight up on its head'. In the corpus 44 to 51 % of flat stands with swords and maces are turned on their side, shields lean (297 of 611), tools lean (187 of 260); 1,176 weapon stands upright and 475 turned with local z down. Rule: a tall weapon or tool goes on a wall stand; on a flat stand only turned on its side so it lies on the surface.",
